==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{af|ru|нормирова́ть|-а́ние}} (suffix-stressed) or {{af|ru|норми́ровать|-ание}} (stem-stressed).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|нормирова́ние|ann=y}}
* {{ru-IPA|норми́рование|ann=y}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|нормирова́ние|or|норми́рование}}

# [[standardization]], [[regulation]] {{gloss|[[establishment]] of [[norm]]s or [[legal]] [[limit]]s}}
# [[standardization]] {{q|of the [[rate]]s of [[production]]}}
# [[rationing]]
# {{lb|ru|algebra}} {{w|absolute value (algebra)|absolute value}} {{gloss|type of [[function]] in [[advanced]] [[algebra]], a [[generalization]] of the [[basic]] [[concept]] of [[absolute value]]}}
